IS
*)

(*"uuid_attribute_schema.__title"
fundamentals_of_product_description_and_support
*)


(*"uuid_attribute_schema"
The subject of the *uuid_attribute_schema* is a description of universally unique identifiers that are compliant to ISO/IEC 9834-8 that can be applied to product data.
*)
(*"uuid_attribute_schema.__fund_cons"

A universally unique identifier is a means that enables a processor to distinguish a data item from other data items, independent of the kind of data items involved. The term univerally unique is to be pragmatically interpreted by implementations, and consistent with the intended application.

The format used to define universally unique identifiers is specified in this document and is compliant with ISO/IEC 9834-8. This document does not provide the capability to exchange a declaration of a namespace as defined in ISO/IEC 9834-8. This document does not provide the capability to exchange a declaration of a name as defined in ISO/IEC 9834-8.

*)
